%% aoneahsan-cccs-typescript — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([TypeScript work: config, upgrade,<br/>or a typing decision]) --> what{Which?}

    what -->|upgrade proposed| tscheck[/Check the ledger:<br/>~/.claude/rules/package-version-known-issues.md/]
    tscheck --> live["Live test:<br/>npm view @typescript-eslint/typescript-estree@latest<br/>peerDependencies.typescript"]
    live --> allowed{Peer range<br/>allows the target?}
    allowed -->|no| pin[PIN typescript ~6.0.3.<br/>TS7 breaks typescript-eslint AND cap sync.<br/>TS 6.1+ is already out of range]
    allowed -->|yes| capcheck{Does cap sync transpile<br/>a .ts config under it?}
    capcheck -->|no| pin
    capcheck -->|yes| upgrade[Upgrade + run all gates]
    pin --> migrate

    what -->|configuring tsconfig| migrate[Apply the TS7-ready migration:<br/>drop baseUrl, relative paths,<br/>drop ignoreDeprecations]
    migrate --> strict[strict: true, no experimental extras<br/>sourceMap/declarationMap/inlineSourceMap: false]

    what -->|typing a value| boundary{Is this a module<br/>boundary?}
    boundary -->|yes| annotate[Annotate it — exports, API<br/>responses, props]
    boundary -->|no| infer[Let inference work.<br/>Over-annotating internals drifts]
    annotate --> derive
    infer --> derive
    derive{Does an equivalent type<br/>already exist?}
    derive -->|yes| reuse["Derive it: z.infer, ReturnType,<br/>keyof, indexed access.<br/>Never hand-maintain a parallel type"]
    derive -->|no| shape{Multiple states<br/>with different data?}
    shape -->|yes| union[Discriminated union —<br/>make impossible states unrepresentable]
    shape -->|no| plain[Plain type]

    what -->|compiler rejects a change| triage{Which is actually true?}
    triage -->|types right,<br/>code wrong| fixcode[Fix the code]
    triage -->|type is wrong| fixtype[Fix the type at the boundary, once]
    triage -->|checker cannot<br/>see what you can| narrow[Narrow explicitly. If asserting,<br/>add a comment saying WHY it is safe.<br/>An unexplained cast is a delayed bug]

    strict --> anyrule
    reuse --> anyrule
    union --> anyrule
    plain --> anyrule
    fixcode --> anyrule
    fixtype --> anyrule
    narrow --> anyrule
    upgrade --> anyrule
    anyrule{Any 'any' introduced?}
    anyrule -->|yes| unknown[Replace with unknown —<br/>force the narrowing at the boundary]
    anyrule -->|no| done
    unknown --> done
    done([Run typecheck + lint + build])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class what,allowed,capcheck,boundary,derive,shape,triage,anyrule gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
    class pin,tscheck warn
